        name = "64-bit user register 1";
        desc = "USER_REGISTER1 is 64-bit user register 1.

Data sheet 3.9.7 USER_REGISTER1 (internal address 0x53, printed page 3-193, `hi3516av200--Hi3516AV200-Datasheet.txt` line 14593).";
